{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>消息發佈後，有玩家推測R星和Take Two看到股價下跌，意識到問題的嚴重性，最終才做出了這一決定：發售後再推出實體光盤版本。如果沒有這麼強大的輿論壓力，Take Two不會這麼突然地改變策略。</p>\n<p>玩家表示，R星和Take Two就應該一開始就説清楚，但R星選擇了沉默。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_945791_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_810219.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_544663.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_954319_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_425636_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_945791_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_810219.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_544663.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"R星確認《GTA6》實體光盤版將在發售幾個月後推出\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260625/1782396229_954319_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-25T16:01:20.417233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":9,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"unknown"}}